{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/yxzcd9","slideIndex":7,"text":"Source: report Chapter 5. First complete extension delivery and investigate a documented Cookiebot consent update mechanism. Provide a hand-off to native controls if no supported mechanism is suitable. Improve analogy explanations and uncertainty handling. Then conduct pilot and main comparison. Expected deliverables are an installable prototype within Cookiebot scope, evaluation findings and design recommendations. No preference-profile prediction component is planned. Improvements in comprehension or engagement are hypotheses, not promised findings."}
