{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/adxpaj","slideIndex":8,"text":"Close with the project’s central question. The prototype demonstrates feasibility of the interaction concept, but the research contribution depends on evaluating understanding, fidelity to intent and usability. A preference for one interface alone will not establish informed consent. Report mixed or negative outcomes as findings. Source: report Chapters 1, 4 and 5."}